[TITLE]
;;Project Title/Notes
*MODEL: Sewer catchment model to simulate sewer discharge from Central Fehraltorf to the the treatment plant at ARA Fehraltorf. This model includes the observed transfer flows from RUMLIKON at location 'f02' (node 555) and RUSSIKON at location 'f03' (node 11d). The model is not complete and may still contain errors!
*TRANSFER FLOWS (f02 & f03): measured (in-)flows at f02 and f03. These observations are included as time series inflows (one *.dat file each transfer flow).
*CALIBRATION: Catchment outflow (link Link_2, leading to outfall node ARA_Fehraltorf) corresponds to the ARA inflow monitored by the plant operators (f00_qin_lps_utc0.dat). Some preliminary calibration was done for the period of May 2016 with r02 rain and ARA inflow observations.
*REFERENCE: Keller, C., Barrett, R., Blumensaat, F. (2018).
//Last revision: control rules for all pumps corrected! 12/10/2017 fbl & rb; 03/11/2017: sc slope correction, fbl//
//Last revision: Student thesis of Jonas Metzger (2018) joined Russikon to the Rumlikon area 15/06/2018, jr //

[OPTIONS]
;;Option             Value
FLOW_UNITS           LPS
INFILTRATION         HORTON
FLOW_ROUTING         DYNWAVE
LINK_OFFSETS         DEPTH
MIN_SLOPE            0
ALLOW_PONDING        YES
SKIP_STEADY_STATE    YES

START_DATE           01/31/2020
START_TIME           00:00:00
REPORT_START_DATE    02/01/2020
REPORT_START_TIME    00:00:00
END_DATE             02/10/2020
END_TIME             00:00:00
SWEEP_START          01/01
SWEEP_END            12/31
DRY_DAYS             0
REPORT_STEP          00:05:00
WET_STEP             00:00:15
DRY_STEP             00:15:00
ROUTING_STEP         0:00:12 
RULE_STEP            00:00:00

INERTIAL_DAMPING     PARTIAL
NORMAL_FLOW_LIMITED  BOTH
FORCE_MAIN_EQUATION  D-W
VARIABLE_STEP        0.75
LENGTHENING_STEP     0
MIN_SURFAREA         1.14
MAX_TRIALS           8
HEAD_TOLERANCE       0.0015
SYS_FLOW_TOL         5
LAT_FLOW_TOL         5
MINIMUM_STEP         0.5
THREADS              8

